Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 17:55:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dns: DoT servers can fail over in order, and the health check
 prefers IPv6

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
